== formatters: progress bar
0 / 100 -> ▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱ 0%
788529152 / 15589124313 -> ▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱ 5%
240000 / 900000 -> ▰▰▱▱▱▱▱▱▱▱ 26%
100 / 100 -> ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰ 100%
150 / 100 -> ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰ 100%

